id           = CWE-1085
name         = Invokable Control Element with Excessive Volume of Commented-out Code
abstraction  = Base
structure    = Simple
status       = Incomplete

description : A function, method, procedure, etc. contains an excessive amount of code that has been commented out within its body.

extended description : While the interpretation of "excessive volume" may vary for each product or developer, CISQ recommends a default threshold of 2% of commented code.

notes : https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1085.html
